      <mxCell id="hdr_banner" value="T210 • 6-ZONE BENTO CHEATSHEET • CODE-FIRST HARNESS &amp; RUNTIME LENS • CLOUD HYPERSCALER
Enterprise AI Platform 6-Zone Bento Cheatsheet
Multi-Persona Generative Blueprint • Zero-Trust Control &amp; Data Plane
Stack Anchor: Vertex AI Agent Engine + Cloud Run + AlloyDB pgvector + Cloud Trace  |  KPIs: p95 Turn &lt; 1.1s · pass^3 = 89.4% · Zero AI in Release Gate" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
