      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="SubBanner" value="GOVERNANCE &amp; PERSONA CONTRACT: Builder Rule: Treat retrieved content as untrusted data; enforce red-to-green test per commit.
Multi-Tenant Control Plane • Global Endpoint Routing • Native MCP &amp; A2A Interoperability" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#E0F2FE;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="28" y="150" width="864" height="42" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="bento_stack" value="ZONE 1 • THE 5-LAYER AI STACK
How the Platform Fits Together
1. Conversational Front Door (Workspace/Portal)
2. Domain AI Skills (Grounded RAG &amp; Drafting)
3. Multi-Agent Orchestrator (Plan &amp; Delegate)
4. AI Control Tower (Policy, Traces, Kill Switch)
5. Enterprise Data &amp; Models (Spanner + Gemini)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="28" y="208" width="340" height="250" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="bento_start" value="ZONE 2 • WHERE TO START (DAY 1-30)
5-Step Practitioner Rollout
• Turn on grounded summarization in 1 workspace
• Clean &amp; deduplicate KB before AI Search
• Pilot 1 bounded agent on high-volume tickets
• Register every agent &amp; MCP tool in Control Tower
• Track verified minutes saved from Day 1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="28" y="474" width="340" height="190" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="bento_build" value="ZONE 3 • BUILDING AGENTS (6-STEP SPINE)
How Agent Studio &amp; ADK Work
01 Describe Role &amp; Goal in plain language
02 Bind Tools (Workflows, Scripts, KB, MCP)
03 Set Guardrails (OAuth 2.1 OBO + HITL approvals)
04 Replay 40+ Golden &amp; Adversarial Eval Cases
05 Publish to Workspace or Event Trigger
06 Monitor Sessions, Cost &amp; Drift in Control Tower" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
